commit 329df59955bf2f65f2b9a1fda4a1bae97b797aa9
Author: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Sun Oct 4 06:49:51 2026 +0000

    CI-1b nit: an in-flight entry that landed before the kill counts once
    
    The reply's in-flight trade ids are kept; an opened trade among them is now a position,
    so it comes off the in-flight count and `keep` does not count it twice. Test: the frozen
    reply shows the stub's next trade in flight (fails before: keep 2).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VgCLpHWaM7FjpwofRcgrwM

